  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sockerr&#xf6;r f&#xf6;r etanol</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sugar Cane Rec. For  Dev.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet skall utreda m&#xf6;jligheten att tillverka etanol lokalt i Zambia f&#xf6;r anv&#xe4;ndning fr&#xe4;mst som motorbr&#xe4;nsle, men &#xe4;ven f&#xf6;r energi- framst&#xe4;llning. Projektet kommer att resultera i en studie , som st&#xe4;llstill zambiska regeringens f&#xf6;rfogande. Som r&#xe5;vara skall anv&#xe4;ndas av- fallsprodukter fr&#xe5;n sockerindustrin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intention behind the project is to establish whether ethanol can be produced locally in Zambia, using waste products from the sugar- industry, for use mainly as fuel for cars but also for producing energy.</narrative>
  </description>
